. Recruitment Consultants We take care of the little things, you have time to do the big things; delighting your clients. Popular features Native job posting Write your ad once and we’ll automatically post it to multiple job boards AI and Skill Matching Automatically discover candidates who match your open roles Integration partners Discover new integrations to supercharge your recruitment process Reporting and insights Enjoy great insights into your business, empowering you to make smart decisions. Browse all features Customers Resources Resources Helpful tips, tools and resources to make your life easier Open product demos Join our next open product demo to see JobAdder in action. Recruitment blog Industry insights, updates and inspiration for recruitment and staffing experts FAQs Quick answers to some of the questions we get asked most Resources hub An extensive collection of webinars, ebooks, checklists and tools to help you stay ahead Trust Centre You own and control your data, we protect and defend it JobAdder Academy A quick overview of our in-app training and certification Access customer support Log into your JobAdder account to access our expert support Check platform status See planned maintenance and system performance Featured reads Resource 2026 State of Recruitment Report | JobAdder Resource BDX 2025 Summit Resource How generative AI is shaping the future of recruitment Partners Partners Explore our marketplace Integration partners Discover more than 100 seamless integrations and tools, empowering you to create your perfect tech stack. Job boards Connect your JobAdder account to more than 200 job boards across the globe. Sourcing Find the best candidates with our seamless sourcing integrations. Onboarding Ensure a smooth transition from recruitment to onboarding with our fantastic onboarding integrations. Recruiter productivity Boost recruiter productivity with these essential integrations and tools. Billing and invoicing Stay on top of your billing and invoicing with our range of integration partners. Assessment tools Streamline your candidate assessment tasks with these amazing tools. Marketing Struggling to manage your marketing to candidates and clients? Check out these marketing integrations. Reference checks Save time with automated and seamless background screening and reference check integrations. The impact of integrations Resource How generative AI is shaping the future of recruitment Resource Boost revenue and productivity with marketing automation Resource Hiring and scaling teams in the modern dispersed workplace Company Company Connect with our JoyAdders About us Learn about the JobAdder team and how we work together. Join the team Want to help spread some Joy with us? Take a look at our opportunities. Partner with us Help make the end-to-end recruitment experience more efficient and joyful. Platform updates Get all the info you need on our latest tech. Media enquiries Got a media enquiry or request? We’d love to hear from you. Contact Send a general enquiry and view our contact details. We can’t wait to chat with you. Featured reads Resource Recruitment Benchmarking Report 2025 Resource BDX 2025 Summit Pricing AI Sign in Search Sign in AI Free demo AI Free demo Search for: The intelligent recruitment platform for growing agencies Energise your team and fuel your growth with powerfully simple technology Book a demo Get pricing Intuitive AI built in to your recruitment software Win new business and place quality candidates faster with Adder Intelligence: JobAdder’s powerfully simple AI. See AI in action Shortlist faster with AI insights Get an instant summary and relevancy rating on every candidate who applies to a job, based on resumes, notes, and job descriptions. Create client-ready overviews instantly Create concise, float-ready AI-driven candidate overviews, using resume content and recruiter notes. Keep your database fresh and accurate Get prompts to update candidate records, as AI scans your 